  {
   "id": "flightpath-adventures-in-venaris-294233@1.01",
   "gameId": "flightpath-adventures-in-venaris-294233",
   "displayName": "Hotfix 1.01",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-01-30T06:50:35.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "First and foremost, thank all of you for playing Flightpath!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "After a handful of people played the game, we started getting some feedback. There's a lot we want to add but it's going to take time.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "For the time being, we made a few quick adjustments. Nothing major, but here's a quick overview of what's been changed:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an off issue that made some enemies spawn after the MISSION CLEARED message appeared",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added a small in-game options menu during pause (volume, full screen on/off, slowdown on/off)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"Defend installations\" become active just when the event starts, to prevent unintended collateral damage of nearby installations.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a minor behavior bug with some bosses' turrets.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an unwanted behavior that allowed out of screen enemies to shoot.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
