  {
   "id": "flightpath-adventures-in-venaris-294233@post-2022-11-22",
   "gameId": "flightpath-adventures-in-venaris-294233",
   "displayName": "Demo updated!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2022-11-22T09:18:37.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Version 0.29 of Flightpath is now live!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We've fixed a good amount of bugs from the previous version, as well as implemented a few new features based on your feedback!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "One of the common comments we received was how frustrating it was to instantly lose if you accidentally clipped a very strong enemy, like The Junkyard King. This has been addressed by setting a max-damage cap, and a temporary grace period. This change should make the game a lot more welcoming to people new to the shmup genre.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We also added an option to turn off the slowdown effect during the comms in-game. If you want to take your time to read, leave the option on, but if you just want to jump to the action, go ahead and turn the slowdown off.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "AJ is also now playable up to stage 3! Explore a new storyline as you try to defeat the Syndicate!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Besides that, a lot of changes to audio and UI improvements.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "For details, you can read the patch notes here",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "v 0.29",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted audio normalization for most audio clips",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Introduced audio ducking for important audio clips",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a problem when several weapons sharing the same audio clip played at the same time, causing audio saturation.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a problem when several enemies would explode at the same time, spiking the volume up.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a visual bug that would make an enemy formation pop on the screen instead of flying in.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved credits crawls at the end of the game, customizable for PC/console versions (with / without publisher)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved energy booster drop logic, trying to drop a booster whenever the player needs it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Initial enemy balance for all AJ stages.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Replaced placeholder assets with final version",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
